      "zh": {
        "title": "漢莎航空旗下 Discover Airlines 退役最後一架 A330-200",
        "summary": "Discover Airlines 完成 A330-200 退役；首航客機 D‑AXGE 結束服務",
        "body": [
          "漢莎航空旗下 Discover Airlines 於 2026 年 10 月 28 日確認退役最後一架空中巴士 A330-200（註冊號 D-AXGE），該機執行末班商業航班 4Y51，從費城國際機場 (PHL) 飛往法蘭克福機場 (FRA)，於當地時間 06:36 降落。",
          "該機齡 22 年，2004 年交付卡達航空，2016 年轉往 SunExpress，2020 年 SunExpress 停飛。首席財務長 Marcel Chmielorz 指出 D-AXGE 曾執行 Discover Airlines 2021 年 7 月首條載客航班，標誌著航空公司長途發展的重要篇章結束。",
          "根據 ch-aviation 資料，機隊現有 18 架 A320-200 及 15 架 A330-300；預計 2027 年中起陸續接收 13 架 A350-900。"
        ]
      },
      "en": {
        "title": "Discover Airlines retires its last Airbus A330‑200, the aircraft that flew its first commercial flight",
        "summary": "Discover Airlines retires final A330‑200; first‑flight aircraft D‑AXGE ends service",
        "body": [
          "Lufthansa’s Discover Airlines confirmed on 28 October 2026 the retirement of its last Airbus A330‑200 (registration D‑AXGE). The aircraft operated the final commercial flight 4Y51 from Philadelphia International Airport (PHL) to Frankfurt Airport (FRA), landing at 06:36 local time after an almost seven‑hour overnight sector.",
          "The 22‑year‑old jet was delivered to Qatar Airways in 2004, moved to SunExpress in Germany in 2016, and SunExpress ceased operations in 2020. CFO Marcel Chmielorz noted that D‑AXGE operated Discover Airlines’ very first passenger flight in July 2021, closing a key chapter in the carrier’s long‑haul history.",
          "According to ch‑aviation, the fleet now comprises 18 Airbus A320‑200s and 15 A330‑300s. Starting mid‑2027, Discover Airlines is scheduled to begin receiving 13 Airbus A350‑900s."
        ]
      },
